# Machine Learning Project

## Summary

This project demonstrates my understanding of artificial intelligence and machine learning concepts through practical exercises. It covers data representation, classification, nearest neighbor algorithms, text analysis, and model evaluation while helping me develop problem-solving skills.

**Building AI course project**

## Introduction

The purpose of this project is to explore fundamental AI concepts and understand how machine learning algorithms can be used to analyze data, make predictions, and solve problems.

## Topics Covered

* Introduction to Artificial Intelligence
* Machine Learning Fundamentals
* Data Representation
* Nearest Neighbor Classification
* Bag of Words
* Term Frequency and TF-IDF
* Model Training and Testing
* Model Accuracy and Evaluation

## Objectives

* Understand the basic principles of artificial intelligence.
* Practice machine learning concepts through exercises.
* Learn how to evaluate model performance.
* Develop problem-solving and analytical skills.

